<h2>UI Components (live examples from the unified CSS)</h2>

<p>These are the exact classes used by the real chat, settings, login, and sidebar. They pull tokens from the same :root.</p>

<div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Buttons</h3>
    <button class="btn-primary" style="margin-right: .5rem;">Primary Action</button>
    <button class="btn-danger">Danger / Delete</button>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" style="margin-left: .5rem; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block; padding:.5rem 1rem; border-radius:6px;">Outline Secondary</a>
</div>

<div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Conversation / Sidebar Items</h3>
    <div class="conversation-item" style="max-width: 320px;">
        <div class="row-top">
            <div class="title">Sample Local Conversation</div>
            <div class="menu"><button class="menu-button">⋮</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="date">Jun 5</div>
    </div>

    <div class="conversation-item active" style="max-width: 320px; margin-top: 4px;">
        <div class="row-top">
            <div class="title">Active One (with blue accent)</div>
            <div class="menu"><button class="menu-button">⋮</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="date">Today</div>
    </div>
</div>

<div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Chat Bubbles (message-me / message-bot)</h3>
    <div class="message-row"><div class="message-me">User message — uses --bubble-blue</div></div>
    <div class="message-row"><div class="message-bot">AI reply — white card with subtle border</div></div>
</div>

<div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Form Controls (from settings polish)</h3>
    <label style="font-size:.85rem; color:#555; display:block; margin-bottom:.25rem;">Example API Key</label>
    <input type="text" class="form-control" value="sk-..." style="max-width: 420px;" />
    <button class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:.75rem;">Save Keys</button>
</div>

<div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Brand + Icons</h3>
    <a class="cf-brand" href="#" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-dark); text-decoration:none;">
        <img width="32" src="/images/chatfish.png" alt="Chatfish" /> Chatfish
    </a>
    <span style="margin-left:1rem; color:var(--primary-dark);"><i class="bi bi-gear" style="font-size:1.2rem;"></i></span>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: .9em; color: #666;">
  Tip: change a token in <code>css/chatfish.css</code> (e.g. --primary-blue) and reload — both this guide and the live /wasm-chat + /wasm-settings will update.
</p>
